WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Luke dashes after the prerequisite Perfect-light knockdown.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.400
Luke backs away from Ryu’s recorded throw attempt.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.150
Standing heavy punch catches the missed throw as Punish Counter.

4
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.750
Perfect light Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

5
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.450
Jumping medium punch catches Ryu in the air.

6
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.350
A delayed, short-held air light Flash Knuckle continues the juggle.

7
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.100
Light Rising Uppercut finishes as Ryu reaches the corner.
